Package: x-messenger
Version: 1.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: nodejs, openssl
Maintainer: jackh0006 <jackh109867@gmail.com>
Description: X Messenger offline encrypted QR courier
 X Messenger encrypts local messages for QR, text, and file transfer.
 It has no service, account, or Internet permission in its Android counterpart.
